  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Lobster Pasta.png|left|200px|Lobster pasta]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 79\n |price = 1 to 637\n |time = 2 h\n |source = {{Infoicon|pastak|bigger|link=Pasta Kitchen}}\n |xp = 76\n |base = 177\n |dia = 5\n |time3 = 1 h 42 min\n}}\n'''Lobster pasta''' is a [[products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 79.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making lobster pasta'''===\n[[File:Pasta Kitchen.png|150px|left|Pasta Kitchen]]\nLobster pasta is made in the [[Pasta Kitchen]].\n\nTo make lobster pasta, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Lobster Tail.png|75px|Lobster tail|link=Lobster Tail]]\n|[[File:Cream.png|75px|Cream|link=Cream]]\n|[[File:Fresh Pasta.png|75px|Fresh pasta|link=Fresh Pasta]]\n|[[File:Tomato.png|75px|Tomatoes|link=Tomato]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x4'''\n|}\nIt takes 2 hours to make a plate of lobster pasta, and 1 hour and 42 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] kitchen. Each plate gives players 76 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling lobster pasta'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Lobster pasta can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 6,372 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 plates.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make lobster pasta costs 602 {{Infoicon|Coin}} coins.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 lobster pasta per crate, up to a total of 4 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n* Lobster pasta is very hard to find in the [[Daily Dirt]].\n* It requires 2 bowls of cream and 4 tomatoes, careful not to run out of either.\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Nudeln mit Hummer\n|es = Pasta con langosta\n|fr = Pâtes au homard\n|it = Pasta all'aragosta\n|nl = Pasta met Kreeft\n|no = Hummerpasta\n|ru = Паста с раком\n|zh = Lobster Pasta\n}}\n[[pt-br:Macarrão com lagosta]]\n\n[[Category:Pasta Kitchen Products]]\n[[Category:Cream Products]]\n[[Category:Tomato Products]]\n[[Category:Lobster Tail Products]]\n[[Category:Fresh Pasta Products]]",
